# The key change on the drop: the DROP edit page (the last) sets it (SAME, +2, +3, +5, +7); when a breakdown or a build gives way to the
# groove the engine's root rises; the next breakdown puts it back. The piece's own root is left alone.
seed 0
wait 3000
press SEL
tap FX
release SEL
wait 100
# (talk and wah come after the flanger now: two more turns to the same pages)
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
spin SELECT 1
wait 30
expect fxpage 18
spin K1 1
wait 50
expect keyset 1
tap FX
wait 100
expect keyon 0
# a breakdown, a build, the drop: the key goes up by two
tap SAVE
wait 3000
expect sec 1
expect keyon 0
tap SAVE
wait 11000
expect sec 0
expect keyon 1
shot keydrop_on.png
# the next breakdown: back
tap SAVE
wait 3000
expect sec 1
expect keyon 0
